# The Catalogue schedule. Install with:  crontab deploy/crontab
# Times are in the server's time zone (UTC on a new EC2 server). IST = UTC + 5:30.
#
# m   h     dom mon dow  command
*     *     *   *   *    $HOME/the_catalogue/deploy/run.sh bot
0     */3   *   *   *    $HOME/the_catalogue/deploy/run.sh products
30    21    *   *   *    $HOME/the_catalogue/deploy/run.sh collections
30    22    *   *   *    $HOME/the_catalogue/deploy/run.sh backup
#
# bot          every minute       answers Telegram messages (long-polls up to 50 s)
# products     every 3 hours      05:30, 08:30, 11:30 ... IST
# collections  21:30 UTC daily    03:00 IST (about 11 minutes)
# backup       22:30 UTC daily    04:00 IST
